State shooting complex-funding amendment. 25LSO-0802, 1.1
FISCAL NOTE
No significant fiscal or personnel impact.
This bill amends the conditions on previously appropriated funds in 2023 Wyoming
Session Laws, Chapter 146, Section 3(b), by removing the requirement that the
amounts appropriated only be expended through additional action of the
Legislature.
The bill also states that the amounts previously appropriated shall only be
expended by the Department of State Parks and Cultural Resources for the siting
and construction of the Wyoming state shooting complex.
